{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://capstone.example/schemas/project-architecture.schema.json",
  "title": "Project architecture",
  "description": "R141: capstone-project-architecture/1 \u2014 a team's project as the record reads it (src/lib/docs/projectRecord.ts): the version (one more than the replaced versions the history holds, migration 0025), the values by area, the design decisions with who chose and when, the risk and exception rows, the history of changes, the conflicts found, and each validation checkpoint with what was offered, answered and correct. Team-level; the instructor console builds and downloads it.",
